{"ordinal":9666,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454627860481","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_5_0d262a6","source":"Sirin: Тогда, наконец, не о чем будет переживать, нечего бояться, тревожиться, стесняться.","target":"Sirin: Atunci, în sfârșit, nu vom mai avea pentru ce să ne facem griji, de ce să ne temem, să ne neliniștim sau să ne fie rușine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9667,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454627860480","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_5_05735e3","source":"Sirin: Теперь я буду за ней ухаживать, пока мы все не умрём.","target":"Sirin: De acum voi avea eu grijă de ea până când vom muri cu toții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9668,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666187","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_5_0e7c428","source":"Sirin: Мне кажется, она совсем лишилась сил.","target":"Sirin: Mi se pare că și-a pierdut de tot puterile.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9669,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666186","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_5_0c61ecf","source":"Sirin: Он рассказывал ей, что всё будет хорошо, а потом убил себя, испугавшись настоящего конца.","target":"Sirin: Îi spunea că totul va fi bine, iar apoi s-a sinucis, speriat de sfârșitul adevărat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9670,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666185","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_5_0819a12","source":"Sirin: Да. Она нашла тело мужа.","target":"Sirin: Da. A găsit trupul soțului ei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9671,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666184","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_sirin_5_09f605d","source":"Мне надо тебя проверить","target":"Trebuie să te verific","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9672,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666183","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_sirin_5_0f926ac","source":"Вы всё же выходили?","target":"Ați ieșit totuși?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9673,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666182","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_sirin_5_08f46e1","source":"Sirin: Вот и конец.","target":"Sirin: Iată sfârșitul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9674,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666181","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_4_0829a24","source":"Sirin: Не хочу её потерять до того, как мы все умрём.","target":"Sirin: Nu vreau s-o pierd înainte să murim cu toții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9675,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666180","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_4_0819f43","source":"Sirin: Если она всё же сорвётся искать его, мне придётся пойти тоже.","target":"Sirin: Dacă totuși pleacă să-l caute, va trebui să merg și eu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9676,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666179","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_4_0373145","source":"Sirin: У меня есть ощущение, что это плохая идея. Но она уже не может спокойно сидеть.","target":"Sirin: Simt că nu e o idee bună. Dar nu mai poate sta liniștită.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9677,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666178","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_4_0737e56","source":"Sirin: Да. Чтобы перестать думать о плохом, она собирается поискать мужа.","target":"Sirin: Da. Ca să nu se mai gândească la lucruri rele, are de gând să-și caute soțul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9678,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666177","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_sirin_4_0500bc0","source":"Мне надо тебя проверить","target":"Trebuie să te verific","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9679,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454623666176","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_sirin_4_00617bb","source":"Твоей сестре плохо?","target":"Sora ta nu se simte bine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9680,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454619471884","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_sirin_4_019f923","source":"Sirin: Вот и конец.","target":"Sirin: Iată sfârșitul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9681,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454619471883","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_3_02f8c1a","source":"Sirin: Но мою сестру это сильно пугает.","target":"Sirin: Dar pe sora mea o sperie tare gândul ăsta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9682,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454619471882","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_3_0290d53","source":"Sirin: Если планеты не станет, некому будет по нам горевать. Да и не надо.","target":"Sirin: Dacă planeta va dispărea, nu va mai avea cine să ne plângă. Și nici nu-i nevoie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9683,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454619471881","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_3_03be24e","source":"Sirin: Мы никому не нужны, потому что никого больше нет.","target":"Sirin: Nimeni nu are nevoie de noi, fiindcă nu mai există nimeni.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9684,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454619471880","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_3_0ecf1e2","source":"Sirin: В бесконечно развивающейся Вселенной мы – никто.","target":"Sirin: Într-un Univers care evoluează la nesfârșit, noi nu suntem nimeni.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
