{"ordinal":9691,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454619471873","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Sirin_Asking_2_08d2c50","source":"Sirin: Не останется даже следа нашего существования?","target":"Sirin: Nu va rămâne nici măcar o urmă că am existat?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-250.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
